stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Down: Node starts
    
    Down --> Joining: Bootstrap begins
    note right of Joining
        Node learns cluster topology
        Receives token assignments
        Streams data from replicas
    end note
    
    Joining --> Normal: Bootstrap complete
    note right of Normal
        Fully operational
        Serving reads/writes
        Participating in gossip
        Heartbeat every 1 second
    end note
    
    Normal --> Leaving: Decommission initiated
    note right of Leaving
        Streams data to new replicas
        Announces departure
        Releases token ownership
    end note
    
    Normal --> Moving: Token rebalance
    note right of Moving
        Changing token assignments
        Streaming data
        Temporary state
    end note
    
    Normal --> Down: Missed heartbeats
    note right of Down
        Failure detector timeout
        Phi > threshold (default: 8)
        Mark as DOWN in gossip
    end note
    
    Moving --> Normal: Move complete
    Leaving --> Left: Decommission complete
    Left --> [*]
    
    Down --> Normal: Node recovers
    note left of Down
        Gossip State Info:
        - Generation (timestamp)
        - Version (increments)
        - Heartbeat counter
        - Application state
    end note
    
    state Normal {
        [*] --> Gossiping
        Gossiping --> SelectPeer: Every 1 second
        SelectPeer --> SendDigest: Choose 1-3 random nodes
        SendDigest --> ReceiveAck: GossipDigestSyn
        ReceiveAck --> UpdateState: GossipDigestAck
        UpdateState --> SendAck2: Reconcile versions
        SendAck2 --> Gossiping: GossipDigestAck2
        
        note right of SelectPeer
            Peer selection:
            - Live nodes (weighted)
            - Dead nodes (occasionally)
            - Seed nodes (priority)
        end note
    }
    
    state FailureDetection {
        [*] --> Monitoring
        Monitoring --> CalculatePhi: Heartbeat received
        CalculatePhi --> CheckThreshold: Phi accrual
        CheckThreshold --> Alive: Phi < 8
        CheckThreshold --> Suspect: Phi >= 8
        Suspect --> Dead: Sustained high Phi
        Alive --> Monitoring
        Dead --> Monitoring: Mark DOWN
        
        note left of CalculatePhi
            Phi = -log10(P(t_now))
            P(t) = probability of
            heartbeat arriving at t
            
            Adaptive to network
            conditions
        end note
    }